.TH MD 1 "2026-10-27" "md 1.6.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
md \- Markdown editor and live previewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B md
.RB [ \-\-new\-window ]
.RI [ file ...]
.br
.B md
.B \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B md
is a Markdown editor with a live preview beside the text. A document opens in
one of three layouts \(em Edit, Split or Preview \(em and is saved in place, in
the encoding and line endings it came with, one second after the last
keystroke. The preview draws KaTeX math with mhchem chemistry, Mermaid,
Graphviz and PlantUML diagrams and highlighted code with bundled open source
engines, and plots with none. Documents export to PDF, HTML, EPUB, LaTeX and
TextBundle; a folder of Markdown files can be written and compiled as a book.
.PP
md runs as a single instance per session: a second
.B md
hands its files to the one already running, which opens each in its own
window, or brings the window forward if the file is already open, and exits.
.PP
Each
.I file
may be a Markdown file
.RI ( .md ,
.IR .markdown ,
.IR .mdown ,
.IR .markdn ,
.IR .mdtext ,
.IR .mdtxt ,
.IR .mkd ,
.IR .mkdn ,
.IR .mdwn ,
.IR .mkdown ),
a plain text file
.RI ( .txt ,
.IR .text ),
a PlantUML
.RI ( .puml ,
.IR .plantuml ,
.IR .iuml ,
.IR .pu )
or Graphviz
.RI ( .gv )
diagram, or a TextPack
.RI ( .textpack )
or TextBundle folder
.RI ( .textbundle ),
which are imported as their text. With no file, md reopens the documents and
drafts it had open when it last quit, or a new untitled document.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-new\-window
Open a new untitled document window, in the running md if there is one.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print the options and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/md/
The preview engines
.RI ( rich/ )
and the examples of the File menu's Examples submenu.
.TP
.I ~/.config/md/settings.conf
Settings: the layout remembered for each recently opened file (by a hash of
its path), the PDF page size, the book folder and the three typing switches of the Edit menu.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/md/session.json
The documents and drafts open when md last quit, with their layout and size.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/md/drafts/
Untitled documents not yet saved, kept until they are saved or discarded.
.TP
.I /etc/apparmor.d/md
The AppArmor profile that lets the preview's sandbox start on Ubuntu.
.PP
The folders follow
.BR XDG_CONFIG_HOME ,
.B XDG_STATE_HOME
and
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
when they are set. The package removes none of them; they are the user's.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MD_DATA_DIR
Read the preview engines and examples from this folder instead of
.IR /usr/share/md .
.SH PRIVACY
md sends nothing anywhere and has no account. It touches the network only to
fetch an image a document refers to by URL, and the
.B cover:
image an EPUB export's front matter names by an https URL. See
.IR /usr/share/doc/md/PRIVACY.md.gz .
